1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,349
Three hours ago, this was supposed to be a simple delivery.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,851
Pier Nineteen. Midnight. Do not open the package.

3
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,343
I should have walked away the moment I saw that box.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:18,976
What the hell is this?

5
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,921
By then, half the city was looking for me.

6
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:31,119
You were never meant to deliver it. You were meant to disappear.

